---
import HeroFlipText from "./HeroFlipText.astro";
---

<section
  id="top"
  class="relative w-full min-h-[max(600px,86vh)] flex flex-col justify-end overflow-hidden select-none bg-black text-white px-6 sm:px-[5.5%] pb-8 sm:pb-9 pt-24 sm:pt-28 md:pt-32"
>
  <!-- Hero Background Image -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full z-0 overflow-hidden">
    <img
      src="/button_underdesk.jpg"
      alt="Diskrétní tísňové tlačítko Vochránka pod stolem v ordinaci"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover object-[center_30%]"
      loading="eager"
      fetchpriority="high"
      width="1024"
      height="1024"
    />

    <!-- Gradient overlay matching reference CSS (90deg, #000a 0%, #0004 55%, #0001) + (0deg, #0009, #0000 55%) -->
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/65 via-black/30 to-black/10 pointer-events-none"
    >
    </div>
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent pointer-events-none"
    >
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Bottom Hero Block matching reference: .hb -->
  <div
    class="relative z-10 w-full mt-14 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-end gap-8"
  >
    <h1
      class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[100px] xl:text-[100px] font-bold tracking-tight text-white uppercase leading-[0.98]"
    >
      Obtěžoval<br />
      vás někdo<br />
      <HeroFlipText />
    </h1>

    <div
      class="max-w-85 md:text-right flex flex-col md:items-end gap-5 text-[17px] leading-relaxed"
    >
      <p class="text-white">
        Jste sami ve svém salonu, kavárně či večerce a zákazník se začne chovat
        divně? Podržením tlačítka spustíte <span
          class="text-[#E07A5F] font-bold">výstražnou sirénu</span
        > a pošlete <span class="text-[#74A869] font-bold">nouzovou SMS</span>.
      </p>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <a
          href="#vyuziti"
          class="underline underline-offset-4 text-sm font-medium hover:opacity-80"
        >
          Jak to funguje
        </a>
        <a
          href="#cenik"
          class="inline-block rounded-full px-6 py-3 bg-white text-ink font-medium text-sm hover:bg-neutral-100 active:scale-95 transition-all shadow-md"
        >
          Chci bezpečí
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
